@startuml
title One native wakeup path for communication and automation

left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

component "Claude message" as ClaudeMessage
component "Cron fire" as CronEvent
component "/loop tick" as LoopEvent
component "Monitor condition" as MonitorEvent
component "Lifecycle event" as LifecycleEvent

component "InterAgentCommunication" as IAC
component "Codex InputQueue" as Queue
component "Native pending-work scheduler" as Scheduler
component "Active turn mailbox" as Active
component "New Codex turn" as NewTurn
database "Claude task files" as TaskStore
component "task_* CAS tools" as TaskTools

ClaudeMessage --> IAC : provider translation
CronEvent --> IAC : /root/automation
LoopEvent --> IAC : /root/automation
MonitorEvent --> IAC : /root/automation
LifecycleEvent --> IAC : ordinary message or shutdown Op
IAC --> Queue : Op::InterAgentCommunication
Queue --> Scheduler

TaskTools <--> TaskStore : lock + revision CAS

Scheduler --> Active : thread already active
Scheduler --> NewTurn : idle + trigger_turn

note bottom of Queue
  wait_agent subscribes to the same
  mailbox activity notification.
end note

note bottom of IAC
  No terminal input, prompt hook,
  background shell sleep, or fake user turn.
end note

note bottom of TaskStore
  Task changes are tool-driven in the MVP.
  Initial assignment arrives as a Claude message.
end note
@enduml
